FAN WORKS
Parts of the content are unofficial fan art and fan fiction inspired by existing works (films,
books, games and their characters, props and settings). They are made for fun, are not affiliated
with, endorsed by or sponsored by the rights holders, and earn no money: no ads, no sales, no
commercial work of any kind. All characters, names, trademarks and original works belong to
their respective owners; nothing here claims them. If you are a rights holder and want something
changed or removed, open an issue and it will be dealt with promptly.

